{{!
@template block_rajabsgames/header

The viewer's summary at the top of the course block: picture, name, groups and XP and level progress bars.

Context variables required for this template:
* mypicture - the viewer's user picture (trusted HTML from user_picture())
* myname - the viewer's first name
* mygroups - array of the viewer's groups: name, pictureurl
* myxp, totalxp - XP earned and available
* xppercentage - myxp as a percentage of totalxp; always set, 0 when the course has no XP
* xpcompleted - whether every XP was earned
* haslevel - whether the level progress bar is shown
* mylevel, totallevel - level reached and level count
* levelpercentage - mylevel as a percentage of totallevel; always set, 0 when there are no levels
* levelcompleted - whether the last level was reached

Example context (json):
{
    "mypicture": "<img src=\"https://moodle.example/theme/image.php/boost/core/1/u/f2\" class=\"userpicture\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" alt=\"\">",
    "myname": "Ana",
    "mygroups": [
        {"name": "Group A", "pictureurl": "https://moodle.example/theme/image.php/boost/core/1/g/g1"}
    ],
    "myxp": 30,
    "totalxp": 120,
    "xppercentage": 25,
    "xpcompleted": false,
    "haslevel": true,
    "mylevel": 1,
    "totallevel": 2,
    "levelpercentage": 50,
    "levelcompleted": false
}
}}
<div class="rg_header d-flex align-items-start justify-content-between mb-3 flex-column w-100 px-2">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-center w-100">
        <div class="iv-mr-2">{{{mypicture}}}</div>
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
            <span class="rg_leaderboard_name iv-font-weight-bold mb-0 h5 iv-mr-2">{{myname}}</span>
            {{#mygroups}}
            <img src="{{pictureurl}}"
                 class="rg_group_image iv-ml-2"
                 alt="{{name}}"
                 width="20"
                 height="20"
                 title="{{name}}">
            {{/mygroups}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="small d-flex flex-column w-100 mt-3">
        <div class="progress"
             role="progressbar"
             aria-label="{{#str}}xp, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}"
             aria-valuenow="{{xppercentage}}"
             aria-valuemin="0"
             aria-valuemax="100"
             style="height: 5px">
            <div class="progress-bar {{#xpcompleted}}bg-success{{/xpcompleted}}"
                 style="width: {{xppercentage}}%"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
            <span class="rg_leaderboard_xp">{{#str}}xp, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}: {{myxp}}</span>
            <span>/ {{totalxp}}</span>
        </div>
        {{#haslevel}}
        <div class="progress mt-2"
             role="progressbar"
             aria-label="{{#str}}level, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}"
             aria-valuenow="{{levelpercentage}}"
             aria-valuemin="0"
             aria-valuemax="100"
             style="height: 5px">
            <div class="progress-bar {{#levelcompleted}}bg-success{{/levelcompleted}}"
                 style="width: {{levelpercentage}}%"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
            <span class="rg_leaderboard_level">{{#str}}level, block_rajabsgames{{/str}}: {{mylevel}}</span>
            <span>/ {{totallevel}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/haslevel}}
    </div>
</div>
